title: Define invalid-file warning contract and parity fixtures
updated_at: "2026-07-15T05:07:16Z"
---
Establish the observable contract for invalid backlog files used by show and claim.

Acceptance criteria:
- Enumerate supported warning conditions: missing indexed file, malformed front matter, ID/path mismatch, and a resolvable file absent from the index.
- Add shared or equivalent fixtures and focused assertions for Go, Python, and TypeScript commands, including stderr/stdout or JSON behavior as applicable.
- Document which conditions remain claimable and which prevent mutation, with actionable recovery guidance.